.DS_Store
node_modules/

# Deliberately NOT ignoring what the examples write — output.md, titles.tsv, page-info.txt and
# the results/ bookmark folders. The tree-view hides VCS-ignored files (tree-view.
# hideVcsIgnoredFiles, on by default here), so ignoring them meant running an example produced
# nothing visible in the tree: the .url bookmarks you are meant to double-click, and the summary
# the script opens for you, were both invisible. Seeing your output matters more here than a
# clean `git status`, and untracked files after running something that writes files is honest.

# Temp entry files the runner writes when you run a selection rather than a whole file.
# Normally cleaned up after each run; this catches anything a crash leaves behind.
.runs/
